# Generated client code

- Treat this tree as **read-only**.
- Pro: `scripts/Fetch-JamfProSchema.ps1` → `scripts/Generate-JamfProClient.ps1`
- Classic: `scripts/Fetch-JamfClassicSchema.ps1` → `scripts/Generate-JamfClassicClient.ps1`
- Platform: `scripts/Fetch-JamfPlatformSpecs.ps1` → `scripts/Generate-JamfPlatformClient.ps1`
- Title Editor: `scripts/Assemble-JamfTitleEditorSchema.ps1` or `Fetch-JamfTitleEditorSchema.ps1` → `scripts/Generate-JamfTitleEditorClient.ps1`
- Hand-written DX wrappers belong outside `Generated/`.
- Protect and School are not Kiota-generated.
- Missing XML on Generated members is expected; façades outside this tree must stay documented.
